k"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたし自身握手会は凄い楽しみで\nいつも両手を繋いでピョンピョン\nしているのが基本スタイル。\nですが今回はそれが出来ないので\n申し訳ないです(´;ω;`)泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいつも通り元気なのは\n変わらないので気をなさらずに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではきっと長々書いてしまうと\nふぁみたんは優しいから心配させて\nしまうと思うのでこの辺で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く治りますようにっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/05/02/0564964/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は人生で骨折3回目なんだよね。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故こんなにも骨は弱いのか。\nひなちゃんが牛乳飲みな？♡\nと言ってくれたのですが\n牛乳ココアにいれて毎日\n飲んでるんだけどな〜笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33937":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台の写真を漁っていたら、\n食べ物の写真ばっかりだった。。！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・牛タン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/15/7098094/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんな1人一皿、チケット制には\n不服なご様子でした(_ _).｡o○笑"},{"type":"break"},{"